    "who_this_is_for_HXUUtf": {
      "type": "who-this-is-for",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_HT6hPz": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Postpartum shedding",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/POSTPARTUM_SHEDDING.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "YOUR HAIR DIDN’T BETRAY YOU.\nYOUR HORMONES JUST DROPPED OFF A CLIFF.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Ferrochel® Iron · Ashwagandha 350mg · Vitamin D · Hydrolyzed Collagen 300mg",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>After pregnancy, hormone levels shift fast. At the same time, iron stores are often depleted. That combination can push follicles out of the growth phase early which is why shedding suddenly feels excessive weeks or months later.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ supports both pathways simultaneously. It helps support healthy follicle cycling, iron-dependent growth signaling, and stress-related shedding support without making you figure it all out yourself.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_ybTrBa": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": " Perimenopause & Menopause",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/PERIMENOPAUSE_MENOPAUSE.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Estrogen drops. Androgen sensitivity climbs. Your hair feels it first.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Saw Palmetto 320mg · Beta-Sitosterol 120mg · Ashwagandha 350mg · Selenium · Vitamin D · Tocopherols & Tocotrienols 25mg",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>As estrogen declines during perimenopause and menopause, the protective hormonal environment that kept your follicles in the growth phase starts to disappear. At the same time, your follicles become more sensitive to androgen activity. That’s why thinning at the part, crown, and edges shows up exactly when everything else feels like it’s shifting too.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ supports healthy DHT activity, hormonal balance, cortisol regulation, and the antioxidant defense your follicles lose access to as estrogen drops — all in one daily formula.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_Eqptd3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Hormonal Thinning",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/HORMONAL_THINNING.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Hormonal thinning is rarely just hormonal.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Saw Palmetto 320mg · Beta-Sitosterol 120mg · L-Citrulline 250mg · CoQ10 80mg",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>As hormone patterns shift, follicles can become more sensitive to androgen activity over time. That’s when thinning around the part, crown, and edges usually starts becoming more noticeable.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ supports healthy DHT activity, scalp circulation, and follicle energy production — helping support fuller-looking density at the root. Because hormonal thinning is rarely just hormonal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_FK3FPA": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": " Stress-related Shedding",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/STRESS-RELATED_SHEDDING.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "High stress doesn’t always show up immediately in your hair.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Ashwagandha 350mg · Tocopherols & Tocotrienols 25mg · L-Citrulline 250mg · Alpha-Lipoic Acid 100mg",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>High stress doesn’t always show up immediately in your hair. The shedding usually comes months later — after prolonged cortisol signaling has already pushed follicles into early dormancy.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ was formulated to support stress-related shedding at the source. It helps support healthy cortisol balance while reinforcing the growth environment follicles depend on.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_P6KAdN": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "GLP-1 Medication Users",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GLP-1_MEDICATION_USERS.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Rapid weight loss can trigger nutrient depletion and shedding 2–4 months in.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Ferrochel® Iron · Zinc Bisglycinate 15mg · Vitamin D 125% DV · Hydrolyzed Collagen 300mg · Pea Protein 100mg · Ashwagandha 350mg",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>LP-1 medications like Ozempic, Wegovy, Mounjaro, and Zepbound work by significantly reducing appetite — which often means significantly reducing protein, iron, zinc, and Vitamin D intake. Combined with the metabolic stress of rapid weight loss, this triggers telogen effluvium that shows up 2–4 months in. Most women don’t connect their shedding to the medication until it’s already significant.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ was built to address exactly this gap. Bioavailable iron, zinc, and Vitamin D directly replace what GLP-1 users lose. Collagen and pea protein support strand structure when daily protein intake drops. Ashwagandha addresses the cortisol response that accompanies major metabolic shifts.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_AdLNeq": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Heavy Menstrual Cycles",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/HEAVY_MENSTRUAL_CYCLES.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Heavy periods quietly drain your ferritin. Your follicles feel it before your labs do.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Ferrochel® Iron · Vitamin D · Zinc Bisglycinate 15mg · Hydrolyzed Collagen 300mg",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>Heavy menstrual cycles deplete iron stores month after month. Your standard lab may still call your ferritin ‘normal’ — but your follicles need it above 70 ng/mL to stay in the active growth phase. That gap has been silently stalling your hair growth, sometimes for years, without anyone connecting your hair to your cycle.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ uses Ferrochel® — a chelated form of iron that’s 4x more bioavailable than ferrous sulfate. So your body actually absorbs the iron you’re taking, instead of passing most of it through. Combined with the cofactors iron needs to do its job at the follicle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_JxHx7K": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "PCOS & Insulin Resistance",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/PCOS_INSULIN_RESISTANCE.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Elevated androgens. Insulin sensitivity issues. Thinning at the crown.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Saw Palmetto 320mg · Beta-Sitosterol 120mg · Alpha-Lipoic Acid 100mg · Zinc Bisglycinate 15mg · Vitamin D",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>PCOS and insulin resistance both raise androgen activity at the follicle, even in women who don’t have a formal PCOS diagnosis. Elevated insulin signals the body to overproduce androgens and lowers the protein that keeps free testosterone in check. The result: more DHT activity at your follicles, concentrated thinning at the crown and part, and a hair loss pattern that doesn’t respond to topical treatments alone.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ goes upstream. It supports healthy DHT activity at the follicle while simultaneously supporting insulin sensitivity — because you cannot out-topical a metabolic driver.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_6FcTgM": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Textured & Natural Hair",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/TEXTURED_NATURAL_HAIR.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Growth means nothing if the strand can’t hold onto length.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Hydrolyzed Collagen 300mg · MSM 150mg · L-Citrulline 250mg · Pea Protein 100mg · Hyaluronic Acid 50mg",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>Textured hair is already more vulnerable to dryness, breakage, and tension-related stress at the strand level. So when thinning starts, retention becomes just as important as growth.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW WE SOLVE IT",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ supports strand integrity, scalp health, and structural retention from within — helping support stronger-looking hair over time. Because growth means nothing if the strand can’t hold onto length.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_hpVtkx": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Nutritional Deficiency",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/NUTRITIONAL_DEFICIENCY-DRIVEN_THINNING.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Your follicles may not be getting what they need — even with a healthy diet.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Ferrochel® Iron · Zinc Bisglycinate · Vitamin D 125% DV · Selenium 127% DV · Copper · Niacin · Black Pepper Fruit Extract (absorption)",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>Even with a healthy diet, your follicles may still not be getting what they need. Low iron, low Vitamin D, poor absorption, and chronic stress can all interfere with healthy growth signaling.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ uses bioavailable ingredients your body can actually utilize — helping support nutrient absorption, follicle energy, and healthy growth support simultaneously. No guessing. No piecing together multiple supplements.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_RVUy6Y": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Post-Illness or Post-Surgery Recovery",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/POST-ILLNESS_OR_POST-SURGERY_RECOVERY.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Major physical stress pushes follicles into mass dormancy. The shedding comes later.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Vitamin D 125% DV · Ferrochel® Iron · Zinc · Ashwagandha 350mg · Hydrolyzed Collagen 300mg · Pea Protein 100mg · CoQ10 80mg",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>After a major illness, surgery, COVID, or significant medical event, your body redirects every available resource to survival and healing. Your follicles — biologically non-essential during recovery — get pushed into the resting phase in large numbers. The shedding doesn’t show up during the recovery itself. It shows up 2–4 months later, just when you thought you were getting back to normal.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ was formulated to address exactly this kind of acute physical stress shedding. It supports the full nutritional foundation your body depleted during recovery, the cortisol axis that’s been running on overdrive, and the follicle environment that needs to be reactivated.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_BrnfXX": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "High-Performing Women",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/HIGH-PERFORMING_WOMEN_IN_DEMANDING_CAREERS.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Chronic stress is the quiet driver of cortisol-mediated shedding.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: Ashwagandha 350mg · Tocopherols & Tocotrienols 25mg · L-Citrulline 250mg · Alpha-Lipoic Acid 100mg · Grape Seed Extract 100mg",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>If you’re running a business, a household, a team — or all three — your cortisol has been elevated for longer than you realize. Chronic sympathetic nervous system dominance pushes follicles out of the growth phase, reduces scalp circulation, and accelerates oxidative damage at the follicle. The shedding doesn’t feel acute. It feels like a slow decline you can’t pinpoint.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ supports the cortisol regulation, circulation, and antioxidant defense your follicles lose access to under chronic stress. So you can keep performing without losing your hair as the cost.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_NNnCeN": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Women Who Have Tried Everything Else",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WOMEN_WHO_HAVE_TRIED_EVERYTHING_ELSE.webp",
            "image_overlay_heading": "Starting over keeps feeling exhausting because the formula was wrong.",
            "image_overlay_text": "Key Ingredients: All 19 ingredients in the formula — working across 9 biological pathways simultaneously",
            "problem_label": "THE PROBLEM",
            "problem_heading": "Hair Loss",
            "problem_text": "<p>Most products only target one pathway. Meanwhile your hair may be dealing with stress, hormones, inflammation, circulation issues, and nutrient depletion — all at once. That’s why starting over keeps feeling exhausting.</p>",
            "bottom_box_logo": "shopify://shop_images/logo_2.svg",
            "bottom_box_logo_width": 160,
            "bottom_box_logo_width_mobile": 140,
            "solution_label": "HOW HAIRSCRIPTS™ SUPPORTS IT:",
            "solution_heading": "More Than One Formula",
            "solution_text": "<p>HairScripts™ was built differently. Instead of forcing you to figure out the exact trigger first, it addresses every root cause of thinning simultaneously. So even when you don’t have all the answers yet — you’re still covered.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
